                "textId": "Performance_437901_1407216034_content",
                "value": "{A点头}是说那个吧，那个！\n格连的消息一如既往的灵通，\n我也是刚收到<style=Highlight>寄售架</style>。"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
